  "blurb": "A fully furnished resale villa on the Bang Por hillside of Koh Samui's north coast, with a sea-view pool, a shaded sala and wide timber-slatted terraces looking out across the Gulf. Three bedrooms plus an office that converts into a fourth, three bathrooms and a dedicated gym room, on 721 m² of freehold Chanote land. ฿33,500,000, with very good rental returns — figures on request.",
  "detail": "A HILLSIDE HOME ABOVE THE GULF\nSet on the green slopes above Bang Por on Koh Samui's north coast, this villa is part of a small hillside community of contemporary pool villas, each oriented toward the sea. It is offered as a resale, fully furnished and ready to move into or rent out.\n\nOUTDOOR LIVING\nLife here centres on the pool deck: a sea-view swimming pool framed by sun loungers, a lawn and a timber-slatted sala with hanging rattan chairs and deep lounge seating. Covered terraces run along the front of the house, so every main room opens to the view.\n\nINSIDE\nThe main level holds open-plan living, dining and a dark-toned modern kitchen with an island, all opening onto the pool. There are three bedrooms plus a separate office that can easily be used as a fourth bedroom, three bathrooms, and a dedicated gym room. Interiors are bright and natural — pale timber, white walls, rattan and woven textures — with large glazed doors throughout. Floor plans for the main and lower levels are at the end of the gallery.\n\nINVESTMENT\nThe villa offers very good rental returns; ROI figures are available on request.\n\nKEY FACTS\n3 bedrooms + office (or 4 bedrooms) · 3 bathrooms · gym room\nBuilt area 450 m² · living area 368 m² (indoor + outdoor)\nLand 721 m² · Chanote title · freehold\nSea-view pool, sala & terraces\nFully furnished · resale\nPrice: ฿33,500,000",
